  "description": "Java – The Ultimate Off-Road Adventure Tandem\nThe Java Tandem sets a new standard for off-road adventure touring. Built for riders who demand outstanding handling, stability, and uncompromising performance, the Java is designed to excel with or without a full touring load. Whether you’re tackling rugged trails or exploring unpaved roads, this tandem offers superior traction and smooth handling on any terrain, making it the ultimate choice for serious off-road adventurers.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 29\" (700c) wheels with 45-55mm tires for superior traction and stability\n\nCo-Motion oversize zonally-butted chromoly tubing for strength and lightweight performance\n\nOversized 44mm head tube & unicrown touring fork for enhanced control and handling\n\nProven Co-Motion touring geometry for a comfortable yet rugged ride\n\nRack & fender mounts and dual disc brakes for reliable stopping power and added load capacity\n\nHand-built Boost thru-axle wheels for strength and durability on challenging terrain\n\nMountain handlebar option for a more upright and relaxed riding position\n\nDrivetrain options: Shimano 2x11, Rohloff, or Pinion for smooth and efficient shifting\n\nWith the Java Tandem, you’ll experience the best in off-road touring performance with a bike that’s built to take on everything from technical trails to long-distance adventures. Choose from road drop bars or mountain/trekking handlebars (the Jones H-Bar is a superb choice for this tandem) to tailor the ride to your style.\n\nComplete bike starting at $7,395.00\nConfigure custom features and price options below\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion Java order started!",
